+- A super-admin selecting `dateOfBirth` inside `customers`, `staffUsers`, or `orders { edges { node { user } } }` is denied; on `user(id:)`, `me`, `order(id:).user` it works and logs once per read (Task 2).
+- An app (`MANAGE_USERS`, subscription webhook query, or impersonating `accountUpdate`) never reads or writes it (Tasks 2, 3).
+- The owner's own read writes no event; no event parameter contains the date (Tasks 2, 3).
+- The dashboard customer page still loads for staff who are denied the birthday (Task 5).
