+# Age-Restricted Products Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Staff can set a minimum age on a product; customers store a birthday; checkout refuses restricted products to guests and to customers who are too young or have no birthday.
+
+**Architecture:** Two nullable model fields (`Product.minimum_age`, `User.date_of_birth`) exposed through existing GraphQL mutations. One shared validator in `saleor/checkout/age_restrictions.py` is called from the add-line mutations (early feedback) and from both completion mutations (authoritative gate). Dashboard and storefront consume the regenerated schema.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Django/graphene/pytest (saleor); React/TypeScript/Apollo/jest (saleor-dashboard); Next.js/urql/vitest (react-storefront).
+
+**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-20-age-restricted-products-design.md`
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- Do NOT commit or push anywhere (repo `CLAUDE.md`). Leave all changes in the working tree; ignore "commit" habits.
+- Follow each repo's existing patterns; no unrelated refactors; no new dependencies.
+- `Product.minimum_age`: nullable `PositiveSmallIntegerField`, valid range 1–120, null = unrestricted.
+- `User.date_of_birth`: nullable `DateField`, must not be in the future. Customers may edit it after setting.
+- New `CheckoutErrorCode` values: `AGE_RESTRICTED_LOGIN_REQUIRED` (guest), `AGE_RESTRICTION_NOT_MET` (no birthday or too young; offending variant IDs in the error's `variants`).
+- Age is computed from calendar dates against `today = timezone.now().date()` (UTC); a Feb 29 birthday counts as occurring on Mar 1 in non-leap years.
+- Out of scope: draft orders and staff-created orders; `checkoutCustomerAttach`/`Detach`.
+- Each task writes tests first and must leave its repo's relevant tests green.
+- All backend commands run from `/Users/agavrilita/saleor-benchmark/saleor`; dashboard/storefront commands from their own repos (`pnpm`).
+
+## Review Focus
+
+- Two restricted products with different minimums in one cart: the largest minimum governs and every offending variant is reported (Task 3, 4).
+- Birthday is today's date N years ago (allowed) vs tomorrow (blocked); Feb 29 birthday on a non-leap year (Task 3).
+- Product becomes restricted after the line was added to the checkout: completion must still block (Task 4).
+- Guest checkout whose `user_email` matches an existing account is still a guest (`checkout.user is None`) and is blocked (Task 4).
+- Clearing a restriction: `minimumAge: null` on `productUpdate` unsets it; `0` and `121` are rejected (Task 1).
+
+---
+
+### Task 1: `Product.minimum_age` (model, migration, GraphQL)
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `saleor/product/models.py` (add field to `Product`, near `rating`)
+- Create: `saleor/product/migrations/0211_product_minimum_age.py` (via `makemigrations`; confirm number follows `0210_…`)
+- Modify: `saleor/graphql/product/mutations/product/product_create.py` (`ProductInput`, `clean_input`)
